cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Processed WHO TB Treatment Success Dataset, 2012-2023"
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite both this processed derivative and
  the original source: World Health Organization (WHO) Global
  Tuberculosis Programme public TB data
  (https://www.who.int/teams/global-tuberculosis-programme/data).
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Feili
    given-names: Arman
date-released: "2026-05-10"
abstract: >-
  A cleaned, joined, and filtered country-year analysis table derived from
  public WHO Global Tuberculosis Programme data. The locked sample covers
  1,862 country-years across 180 countries and 12 years (2012-2023) and
  includes treatment success counts, cohort sizes, WHO region, TB burden
  predictors, and standardized versions of the continuous predictors used
  in a Bayesian beta-binomial study of treatment success.
keywords:
  - tuberculosis
  - WHO
  - Bayesian inference
  - beta-binomial
  - treatment success
  - country-year panel
